# Self-hosted LiveSync CLI — Environment Variables
#
# These are passed at runtime (docker run -e or docker-compose environment).
# The CLI uses .livesync/settings.json inside the data directory for config.
# Environment variables below are optional overrides.

# Custom database path (default: /data)
# LIVESYNC_DB_PATH=/data

# Node.js options (e.g. memory limit)
# NODE_OPTIONS=--max-old-space-size=512
